{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-01_beg","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-01","title":"崩落","storyCode":"0-1","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2afe1ccd453f5f10026c8c7ed7ff1c06606920d60c593164fb96d5484928d1ce","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"くっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"どうなってるんだ、この状況は……！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_2_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――探せ！　家の中まで徹底的に調べるんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"やめて！　その人を放して！　一体、どうしてこんなことを……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ハッ、抵抗する気か？　チェルノボーグのクズめ！　今更何しようが遅いんだよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ッ……！　もういい、お前だけでも逃げろ！　俺のことは気にするな……子供たちを、頼んだぞ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――ママ……！　ママ、どこにいるの……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――市民のことなど捨て置け！　総員、防衛ラインを死守せよ！　……クソッ、相手の規模が読めん！　仮面の反逆者どもめ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"皆、手を緩めるな！　隙を与えず攻め続けるんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウルサス憲兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"おい、援軍はまだ来ないのか！？　このままでは……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――行くぞ！　突撃ッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、レユニオン……どうして彼らが、こんなことを……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"恐らく、何年も隠し続けてきた本性がついに牙を剥いた……といったところだろうな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"で、ですが……彼らのような感染者が、ウルサスの国民を……チェルノボーグの市民たちを襲うなんて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"ほんと何考えてんだよ、あの連中……！　感染者がウルサス政府に刃向かったら、タダじゃ済まないってのに！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"だが、この猛攻を見るに、今回の行動は計画的なものと考えて間違いあるまい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"加えて、我々がドクターを救出したあの場所にさえ、レユニオンが侵入していた以上……何らかの陰謀が動いていると見るべきだ。あそこは本来、秘匿されたエリアだからな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"しかし、だとしたらすでに被害はチェルノボーグ全域に及んでいる可能性もある、か……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"クソッ……どうすりゃいいんだ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！　（小声）静かに。彼らが来ます……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"逃げ出した奴らの足取りは掴めたか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"申し訳ありません、現在捜索中です！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"了解、そのまま続けろ。一匹たりとも逃がすなよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――血も涙もないチェルノボーグの連中め……俺の父と母、親の世代が受けた苦しみ、必ず味わわせてやる！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（っ、土ぼこりが……！）　――ごほっ……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……何の音だ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向こうから聞こえたようです！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）ひっ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）き、気付かれ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）――落ち着け。静かに……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）はっ、はい……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……きゃっ……！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"いたぞ！　奴らはここだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……い、いやあああっ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"やめて、来ないで……！　――ど、どこかに隠れないと……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……チッ、どこへ行った……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"逃げ足の速い奴め……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"さっさと出てこい！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ひっ……い、いやっ……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"こそこそ隠れたところで無駄だ。――見つけたぞ、女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ッ……！　ゆ、許してください……！　どうか……どうか、この子だけでも見逃してください……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……これ以上、黙って見てはいられません。――戦いましょう、レユニオンと。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"……アーミヤ。そうは言うが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"もちろん、リスクは承知しています。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"けれどそれでも、こうしている間に失われていく命を、見過ごすわけにはいきません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"その上、この状況がいつまで続くかわからないという意味でも、彼らの撤退を待つ時間はないはずです。静観するよりは、行動すべき局面かと。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ですから――彼らを止めましょう。ドーベルマンさん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"――――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"……わかった。お前の指示に従おう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"――ロドス各小隊に告ぐ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"現状、レユニオンはまだ我々の存在に気付いていないようだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"よって、奇襲で一気に畳み掛ける。総員、迅速に行動せよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"さて、Dr.{@nickname}。ここからはお前に部隊の指揮を委ねよう。――その力量、確かめさせてもらうぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"言うまでもないが、見ての通りの状況だ。手は抜くなよ。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"任せてくれ。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"このくらい、すぐに終わらせてやるさ。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"ふっ。……頼んだぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"では、アーミヤ。号令を。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"はい。――みなさん、行きましょう。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_1_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……「それが避けられる戦いならば、沈黙を守り」――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――「必要な戦いならば、最後まで戦い抜く」！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それが私たち、ロドスの往くべき道ですから！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_1_3"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["前衛オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医療オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["ドーベルマン"]}]}
